# Files that ship in git but must not be served publicly.
#
# There was no .vercelignore before this, and vercel.json set outputDirectory
# to ".", so the entire repository was published — including api/ source (fixed
# separately by dropping the build script) and, still today on main, the Apps
# Script backend: /appscript/SalesHub.js and /appscript/WebhookReceiver.js were
# both readable at 131 KB and 196 KB.
#
# ⚠️ DO NOT add js/ here. api/_repo/quote-write.js does
#    require('../../js/lib/pricing.js') so the browser and the server price a
#    quote with the same engine. Ignoring js/ breaks every quote save.
# ⚠️ DO NOT add fixtures/. agreement.html fetches fixtures/agreement-sample.json
#    to render its demo mode.

# Apps Script backend — deployed via clasp, never served over HTTP.
appscript/

# Design mockups and email previews. Nothing in the app links to them.
previews/
approval-upload/
approval.html
action-center-enterprise-sketches.html

# GAS-side document template, rendered server-side not fetched.
templates/

# Source documents and stray art that should not be downloadable.
template (1).pdf
Full Color.png
